<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνορθόω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνώρθωσα</span> E <i><span class="en">
			<u>Alc.</u>
			1138
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Isoc.
			5.64
		</span></i>, etc.: plpf. with double augm. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνωρθώκει</span>
		v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Lib.
			<u>Ep.</u>
			1039
		</span></i>: the double augm. is common in the compd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανορθόω</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set up again, restore, rebuild,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν νηόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τεῖχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.208
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στρατόπεδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.88
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σῶμά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					364
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνορθοῦσθαι τὰ πίπτοντα τῶν
				οἰκοδομημάτων</span>
			<i>have</i> them <i>rebuilt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1322b20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>restore to health</i> or <i>well being.</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					919d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>set straight again, set right, correct,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1228
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀλλότρια κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					346e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
